{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Spring Seeds are a type of ",["l","打造#Seeds","Crafted"]," seed. The crafting recipe is labeled \"Wild Seeds (Sp)\", but when crafted, the result is \"Spring Seeds.\" Mature plants yield, at random, a ",["l","野山葵","Wild Horseradish"],", ",["l","黄水仙","Daffodil"],", ",["l","韭葱","Leek"],", or ",["l","蒲公英","Dandelion"],"."]],["p",["Spring Seeds are one of the season-specific crafted wild seeds, along with ",["l","夏季种子","Summer Seeds"],", ",["l","秋季种子","Fall Seeds"],", and ",["l","冬季种子","Winter Seeds"]," that produce crops normally found as ",["l","采集","forage"],". While Farming Skill normally increases the chance to grow a quality crop, Foraging Skill increases the chance to grow a quality crop from Spring Seeds. Choosing the ",["l","技能#Foraging","Botanist profession"]," will ensure iridium-quality crops grown from Spring Seeds."]],["p",["Crows do not attack crops grown from Spring Seeds, so the use of ",["l","稻草人","Scarecrow"],"s is unnecessary."]]]],["Sources",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","打造","Crafting"]," (each recipe produces 10 Spring Seeds)"]],[1,["Placing a ",["l","野山葵","Wild Horseradish"]," in a ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"]," (yield: 1-3 Spring Seeds)"]],[1,["Completing the Crafts Room (reward: 30 Spring Seeds)"]],[1,[["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," (price105–1,000g)"]],[1,[["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," on ",["l","周循环#Saturday","Saturdays"]," in exchange for 2 ",["l","夏季种子","Summer Seeds"]]],[1,[["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","Treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern (5-20 each)"]]]]]],["Crops Harvested",2,[["p",["Each Spring Seed has an equal chance of yielding one of any of the ",["l","农作物","crops"]," shown below."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Source"]}],[[["i","(O)18","Daffodil"]],["A traditional spring flower that makes a nice gift."],[["l","采集#Spring","Spring Foraging"]," • Spring Seeds"]],[[["i","(O)22","Dandelion"]],["Not the prettiest flower, but the leaves make a good salad."],[["l","采集#Spring","Spring Foraging"]," • Spring Seeds"]],[[["i","(O)20","Leek"]],["A tasty relative of the onion."],[["l","采集#Spring","Spring Foraging"]," • Spring Seeds"]],[[["i","(O)16","Wild Horseradish"]],["A spicy root found in the spring."],[["l","采集#Spring","Spring Foraging"]," • Spring Seeds"]]]]]],["Stages",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_3.png",64]]],[["3 Days"],["4 Days"],["Total: 7 Days"]]]]]],["Crop Growth Calendar",2,[["t",[[{"c":7,"h":1,"v":["Base"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Mon"]},{"h":1,"v":["Tue"]},{"h":1,"v":["Wed"]},{"h":1,"v":["Thu"]},{"h":1,"v":["Fri"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sat"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sun"]}],[[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]]],[[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]]],[[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]]],[[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Wild_Seeds_Stage_2.png",48]]]]],["t",[[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Agriculturist and Speed-Gro Comparison"]}],[{"h":1,"v":[]},{"h":1,"v":[["f","Speed-Gro.png",24]," ",["l","生长激素","Speed-Gro"]]},{"h":1,"v":[["f","Deluxe_Speed-Gro.png",24]," ",["l","高级生长激素","Deluxe Speed-Gro"]]},{"h":1,"v":