森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["f","Tea_Sapling.png",48]],[["l","茶苗","Tea Sapling"]],["Takes 20 days to mature. Produces tea leaves during the final week of each season, except winter. No watering necessary!"],[["l","打造#Seeds","Wild Seeds (any)"]," (2)",["i","(O)771","Fiber ×5"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×5"]],["Mail the day after ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],"'s 2-heart event"],["250g"]]]]]],["Profitability",2,[["p",["Spring Seeds are a profitable recipe without the ",["l","采集#Foraging Skill","Botanist Profession"],". A craft of Spring seeds yields 10 seeds worth 350g total, while a set of regular-quality ingredients to craft it sells for only 180g and a set of gold-quality ingredients sells for 270g. With the Botanist Profession, selling the individual crops yields 360g."]],["p",["The long run average price from selling the directly resulting forage is 45g at 1/4*(30+40+50+60). However, on average this equates to 2.5 bundles of seeds, worth a total of 875g. This is equivalent to 87.5g per planted seed. Subtracting the cost of the initial seed at 35g each, this is 52.5g profit, or over the growth cycle 7.5g/day."]]]],["Gallery",2,[["p",[["l","打造#Seeds","Wild Seeds"]," from any season may appear similar to dead crops during Stage 2 of growth."]],["g",[["WildSeedsStage2.png",140,[]]]]]],["Bugs",2,[["p",["On ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],", mature Spring Seeds may destroy the tilled soil (and fertilizer), leaving untilled soil in their place after harvest."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can be used in the ",["l","茶苗","Tea Sapling"]," recipe."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Bugfix for stages of growth with ",["l","技能#Farming","Agriculturist"]," + ",["l","顶级肥料","Deluxe Fertilizer"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5.6","1.5.6"],": Dirt under freshly grown seasonal forage seeds no longer disappears randomly, except on Ginger Island."]]]]]]]}